  buy 3713 x3 npc 4897                -- Soothing Spices, for "Swamp Eye" Jarl

step Sentry Point
  tip Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at Sentry Point. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it.
  tip Archmage Tervosh waits at the foot of the tower: once you have looked around, hand the quest in to him there, not in Theramore.
  complete 1265 @59.9,40.9 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 1265 @59.7,41.2 map 1445 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Archmage Tervosh, at the tower
  accept 1266 @59.7,41.2 map 1445 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  collect 5883 quest 1204 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Forked Mudrock Tongue

step Theramore Isle
  buy 3713 x3 npc 4897                -- Soothing Spices: Helenia Olden in Theramore, if you left without them

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Swamplight Manor
  tip Take the road north to the ruined manor; Jarl lives in the shack beside it and the loose dirt is at the corner of the house. Jarl wants three Soothing Spices: if you passed Helenia Olden, buy them from her in Theramore first.
  accept 1219 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Loose Dirt
  accept 1218 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- "Swamp Eye" Jarl
  buy 3713 x3 npc 4897                -- Soothing Spices: Helenia Olden in Theramore, if you left without them
  turnin 1218 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- with the spices from Theramore
  accept 1206 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step "Stinky" Ignatz
  tip Stinky waits west of the manor, in the marsh below North Point Tower. Lead him to his Bogbean leaves and keep the swamp creatures off him.
  accept 1222 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  complete 1222 @48.9,24.6 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step North Point Tower
  tip Private Hendel holds the tower with a few deserters. He turns on you: beat him until he yields.
  tip Careful: Hendel has two guards who join the fight when he turns hostile. The guards flee once he surrenders.
  tip Archmage Tervosh and Lady Jaina Proudmoore wait beside the tower: once he yields, hand in to both on the spot.
  turnin 1266 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Private Hendel
  accept 1324 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  complete 1324 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 1324 @45.2,24.4 map 1445 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Archmage Tervosh
  turnin 1267 direct @45.2,24.3 map 1445 era

step Theramore
  tip Follow the road east back to Theramore. The officers are in Foothold Citadel.
  turnin 1219 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Theramore Lieutenant
  accept 1220 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 1220 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Captain Garran Vimes, on the top floor
  turnin 1222 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Morgan Stern, inside
  turnin 1204 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Morgan Stern
  accept 1258 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Morgan Stern: the crawlers are on the Swamp of Sorrows shore, keep it

step Darkmist Cavern
  tip The Darkmist spiders nest around the cavern in the north-west of the marsh; every spider drops eyes.
  tip Careful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them.
  collect 5884 quest 1206 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Unpopped Darkmist Eye

