# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step The Affray
  only Warrior
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the way north to Ratchet, Fray Island lies off the Merchant Coast south of the town: wade over the sand bar shallows. Klannoc Macleod sends four challengers and then Big Will (level 33) at you, one at a time.
  turnin 1718                             -- Klannoc Macleod
  accept 1719
  complete 1719                           -- Defeat the challengers and Big Will
  turnin 1719                             -- Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance
  note Klannoc offers The Windwatcher next (1791): the Whirlwind weapon chain, with an elite at the end, is in the Warrior class guide Whirlwind Weapon.

