# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Bloodsail

step Bloodsail camp
  tip Leave town by the tunnel and follow the coast north; the letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where "Pretty Boy" Duncan walks.
  tip Careful: the Bloodsail Mages and Warlocks here are level 40-43 and cast from range: pull one at a time and fight with your back to the open beach.
  turnin 595 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Bloodsail Correspondence
  accept 597 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Booty Bay
  accept 576 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dizzy One-Eye
  turnin 597 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 599 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 599 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  accept 604 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- keep it: the Wild Shore camp's charts and Swashbucklers (41-43) wait for the level-48 Booty Bay stop

step Bloodsail pirates: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries Dizzy's eye: take them from the Raiders and Mages (39-41) at the Bloodsail camp on the beach just north of town, where you found the letter. Leave the Wild Shore camp south of town (Warlocks and Swashbucklers 41-43) for the level-48 visit.
  collect 3897 quest 576 @28.0,70.5 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dizzy's Eye

step Booty Bay
  note Fin Fizracket's Stranglethorn Fever (Mokk the Savage) waits for the level-48 Booty Bay stop: leave it for now.
  note Seahorn's Bloodsail Buccaneers: keep it for the level-48 Booty Bay stop, with the Wild Shore camp.
  turnin 576 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dizzy One-Eye

step Gorilla hills
  tip Head inland to the Mistvale gorilla hills. Elder Mistvale Gorillas drop the giblets.
  collect 3919 quest 606 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Mistvale Giblets

step Booty Bay
  tip Head back down to town; Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth.
  turnin 606 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- "Shaky" Phillipe
  accept 607 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 2872 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- for Stoley in Tanaris: keep it; on the top floor
  turnin 607 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley, on the top floor
  accept 609 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley: keep it, for the level-48 Booty Bay stop, with Zanzil's village

step Cortello's scroll
  tip Optional: Cortello's scroll lies inside one of the three Bloodsail ships anchored off the coast just south of Booty Bay, on a middle or lower deck, and is not always on the same ship. Their crews are 42-45 pirates: clear your way from the edge, one at a time, and leave the captains (45-48), whom the route comes back for at 48.
  collect 4056 optional               -- Cortello's Riddle; inside
  accept 624 optional                 -- for the Swamp of Sorrows later

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The jungle

step Jungle Stalkers
  tip The Jungle Stalkers roam the slopes west of the mine.
  kill 687 quest 196.1 @32.1,43.1 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Jungle Stalker

step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip East from the stalkers' slopes to the ruins of Zul'Mamwe: the Skullsplitter Mystics (39-40) in its northern half carry Brother Nimetz's fetishes. Careful: the Witch Doctors, Berserkers and Headhunters (41-44) hold the ruins' southern half: stay north. Then north-west toward the coast: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) prowl the jungle west of the ruins, often stealthed.
  kill 684 quest 192 @42.4,32.5 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Shadowmaw Panther
  collect 2466 quest 205 @45.5,36.5 map 1434 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Skullsplitter Fetish, from the Skullsplitter Mystics

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The far north

step The north-west coast
  tip Go on north-west to the bay on the north-west coast. The Giant Clams lie on its floor and hold the pearls; Gazban swims among them and drops the Stone of the Tides.
  collect 4611 quest 705 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Blue Pearl; underwater

step Sin'Dall
  tip North-east from the bay toward Nesingwary's camp: Sin'Dall, the great tiger (37), lairs on the hilltop just south-west of the camp.
  collect 3879 quest 188 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Paw of Sin'Dall

