  zone Teldrassil
  goto 58.4,93.9 "To Rut'theran Village"

step Fly to Auberdine
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Teldrassil
  goto 58.4,93.9 "Rut'theran Village flight master"
  fly "Auberdine"

step Boat to Stormwind Harbor
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darkshore
  goto 30.5,40.9 "Boat to Stormwind Harbor"

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stormwind City
  zone Duskwood
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"

step Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  turnin 1477 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Watchmaster Sorigal, by the flight master
  turnin 96138 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sirra Von'Indi, inside

step Viktori Prism'Antras
  tip Viktori's house stands at the east end of town, on the way to the flight master.
  turnin 181 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Inside

step To Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 30.4,59.0 "To Lakeshire"

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 30.4,59.0 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  goto 5.5,31.4 "Misty Valley"

step Misty Valley
  tip The scroll lies in the marsh north of Biggs. The Swampwalkers north of it can drop Khadgar's essays.
  collect 6065 quest 1364 @5.5,31.4 map 1435 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence

step Misty Valley
  when onquest 624
  turnin 624

step Cortello's Riddle
  accept 625 optional
  turnin 93176 optional               -- Amaryllis Webb: My Little Friends, from 30-40/05-arathi-highlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Watcher Biggs
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Watcher Biggs stands by the road junction in the west of the swamp.
  accept 1398 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step The sunken temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Head east; the Tangled Horrors along the way also drop the essays. Search the edge of the Pool of Tears, where the temple's ruins break the water.
  goto 70.2,45.2
  complete 1448 @70.2,45.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Misty Reed Strand: kill these as you meet them
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Careful: the big Monstrous Crawlers (43-44) further south on the shore are over you: take the legs at the north end and pick up the driftwood without pulling them.
  collect 5938 quest 1258 @80.0,8.0 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Pristine Crawler Leg, from the Silt Crawlers
  collect 6146 quest 1398 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sundried Driftwood

step Watcher Biggs
  turnin 1398 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 1425 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- for Nethergarde Keep: keep it

step To Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  goto 77.6,44.4 "To Darkshire"

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Duskwood
  goto 77.6,44.4 "Darkshire flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind and Ironforge

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1448 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Brohann Caskbelly
  accept 1449 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- for Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak: keep it

step Tram to Ironforge
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 64.5,7.5 "Tram to Ironforge"

step Klockmort Spannerspan
  zone Ironforge
  accept 2769 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Roetten Stonehammer
  turnin 1457 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Roetten is in the Reclaimers' hall by the Hall of Explorers, Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern.
  turnin 1467 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Roetten Stonehammer
  train class only Shaman             -- Stormwind has no shaman trainer

step Dun Morogh
  only Dwarf
  zone Dun Morogh
  when level>=40
  goto 63.8,50.1 "Amberstill Ranch"

step Riding at 40
  only Dwarf
  zone Dun Morogh
  when level>=40
  tip At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Ultham Ironhorn teaches Dwarves at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan, beside Veron Amberstill's rams. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour.
  train 4772 optional                 -- Ultham Ironhorn
  vendor 1261 optional                -- Veron Amberstill: other colours, 20g

step Dun Morogh
  only Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  when level>=40
  goto 49.2,48.1 "Steelgrill's Depot"

step Riding at 40
  only Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  when level>=40
  tip At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Gnomes at Steelgrill's Depot, just east of Kharanos, beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour.
  train 7954 optional                 -- Binjy Featherwhistle
  vendor 7955 optional                -- Milli Featherwhistle: other colours, 20g
